 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** A sequence of 2D image frames and a set of 3D Gaussians representing the scene.
-*   **Output:** Temporally consistent 3D Gaussian parameters (position, covariance, opacity, color) aligned across frames.
